OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'troublemaker' who captured 50
OL,4,Ayears of rebellion
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Alan Lodge arrived in Nottingham
OL,7,Fto study photography at the age of 40,
OL,8,Fhe did not see himself as an artist.
OL,10,FInstead, he described himself as a
OL,11,F"professional troublemaker".
OL,13,FAfter attending his first free festival
OL,14,Fin 1972, the scene became part of
OL,15,FLodge's life and later, he left a brief
OL,16,Fcareer as an emergency paramedic in the
OL,17,FLondon Ambulance Service to dedicate
OL,18,Fhis life to capturing scenes of
OL,19,Falternative culture.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
