OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'troublemaker' who captured 50
OL,4,Ayears of rebellion
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis passion was initially borne out of
OL,7,Fdocumenting evidence of clashes between
OL,8,Ffestivalgoers and police, which he said
OL,9,Fwere often covered in the media at the
OL,10,Ftime.
